cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use or refer to this archived research software, please cite it as below."
title: "Libera: forensic-first local AI assistance over controlled synthetic conversational evidence"
type: software
version: 1.0.0
date-released: "2026-10-05"
repository-code: "https://github.com/krissimbolon/libera"
abstract: >-
  Archived research implementation of a forensic-first workflow: a frozen synthetic
  Indonesian WhatsApp-style case corpus, a researcher-controlled Android evidence carrier
  (ChatSim), logical acquisition with SHA-256 preservation, artifact extraction,
  a traditional examiner baseline, and local retrieval-augmented LLM assistance whose
  outputs are locked and citation-validated against acquired evidence.
authors:
  - given-names: Christian
    family-names: Simbolon
  - name: "Libera project contributors"
keywords:
  - digital forensics
  - mobile forensics
  - evidence provenance
  - retrieval-augmented generation
  - local LLM
  - citation validation
